{{PAGENAME}} is a low-tier piece of chest [[:Category:Armor|armor]] that provides a small amount of protection and offers a 0%-35% [[Special:SearchByProperty/:Egildatt/Survival|survival]] [[gilding]] slot. It equips to the [[Equipment Screen|equipment slots]] 4L or 4R.

==Quality Formula==

The quality formula of {{PAGENAME}} is <math>\frac{_{q}AvgHide+_{q}AvgString}{2}</math>, [[softcap]]ped by <math>\sqrt{Sewing * Dexterity}</math>.

